":"Organization","name":"Gopeed","url":"https://gopeed.com"},"license":"https://opensource.org/licenses/GPL-3.0","featureList":["Multi-threaded download engine","HTTP/HTTPS protocol support","BitTorrent protocol support","Magnet link support","ed2k link support","Cross-platform (Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS, Web)","JavaScript extension system","RESTful API","Browser extension (Chrome, Edge, Firefox)","Open source"]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What protocols are supported?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Gopeed supports HTTP, HTTPS, BitTorrent, magnet links and ed2k links in the same download client."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does it support intercepting browser downloads?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Install the Gopeed browser extension and it will automatically capture download links from your browser."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is my torrent or magnet link downloading slowly?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"BT download speed depends on the number of seeders, tracker status and your network environment. Try adding more trackers, checking your firewall and port forwarding settings, and making sure DHT is enabled."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does it support proxy settings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can configure HTTP, SOCKS5 proxies or use system proxy in Gopeed's settings. This is useful when direct connections are limited or when you need to route downloads through a specific network."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it free? Are there any paid features?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Gopeed is completely free and open source. All core download features are available at no cost, with no ads and no hidden paywalls."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I manage downloads remotely?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Gopeed provides a RESTful API and a web interface. You can manage download tasks remotely through the API or access the web UI from another device on the same network."}}]}]</script><div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 dark:block hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950 via-gray-900 to-gray-950"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-radial from-primary-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-50"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[800px] h-[600px] bg-primary-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse-slow"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[400px] bg-primary-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse-slow"></div></div><header class="left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 absolute top-4 md:top-4 md:absolute" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20px)"><nav class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 transition-all duration-300 "><div class="relative flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl w-full px-4 py-2 " style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 md:gap-8 z-10"><a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 md:space-x-3"><div class="relative w-7 h-7 md:w-8 md:h-8"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary-500 rounded-lg blur-[8px] opacity-40"></div><img alt="Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_ne