sition-colors duration-500"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-grid bg-[length:20px_20px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-5 dark:group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative z-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors duration-300">Extension Store</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"></path></svg></div><p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Browse and install community-contributed download extensions</p></div></div></a><a href="/docs/dev-extension" class="relative group h-full block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-linear-to-br from-primary-500/30 to-transparent rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 blur-sm transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200/50 dark:border-gray-800/50 group-hover:border-primary-500/30 transition-colors duration-500 h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-primary-500/0 to-transparent group-hover:via-primary-500/50 transition-all duration-500"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-4 -mr-4 w-32 h-32 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-primary-500/20 transition-colors duration-500"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-grid bg-[length:20px_20px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-5 dark:group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative z-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-primary-600 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors duration-300">Development Docs</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"></path></svg></div><p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Learn how to develop your own download extensions using JavaScript</p></div></div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 overflow-hidden" aria-label="Download Manager FAQ"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 relative"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><h2 class="text-3xl section-heading mb-10">Download Manager FAQ</h2><div class="space-y-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">What protocols are supported?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">Gopeed supports HTTP, HTTPS, BitTorrent, magnet links and ed2k links in the same download client.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">Does it support intercepting browser downloads?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">Yes. Install the Gopeed browser extension and it will automatically capture download links from your browser.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">Why is my torrent or magnet link downloading slowly?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">BT download speed depends on the number of seeders, tracker status and your network environment. Try adding more trackers, checking your firewall and port forwarding settings, and making sure DHT is enabled.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">Does it support proxy settings?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">Yes. You can configure HTTP, SOCKS5 proxies or use system proxy in Gopeed&#x27;s settings. This is useful when direct connections are limited or when you need to route downloads through a specific network.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">Is it free? Are there any paid features?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">Gopeed is completely free and open source. All core download features are available at no cost, with no ads and no hidden paywalls.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 bg-white/90 dark:bg-gray-900/80 overflow-hidden"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white pr-4">Can I manage downloads remotely?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-7">Yes. Gopeed provides a RESTful API and a web interface. You can manage download tasks remotely through the API or access the web UI from another device on the same network.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="downloads" class="relative py-20 overflow-hidden" aria-label="Download Gopeed"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-grid bg-[length:50px_50px] opacity-5 dark:opacity-10"></div><div class="absolute top-0 -right-40 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-primary-500/10 dark:bg-primary-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse-slow"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 -left-40 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-primary-500/10 dark:bg-primary-900/20 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse-slow"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 relative"><div class="text-center mb-12" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="text-3xl section-heading mb-4">Download Gopeed</h2><p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Choose the version that fits your platform</p></div><div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto group"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-linear-to-br from-primary-500/30 to-transparent rounded-3xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-700"></div><div class="relative bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/50 dark:border-gray-800/50 group-hover:border-primary-500/30 transition-colors duration-500 shadow-2xl shadow-primary-500/5 overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-primary-500/0 to-transparent group-hover:via-primary-500/50 transition-all duration-500 z-20"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-4 -mr-4 w-64 h-64 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-primary-500/20 transition-colors duration-500 z-10 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-grid bg-[length:20px_20px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-5 dark:group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500 z-10 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="relative z-20 w-full md:w-64 bg-gray-50/50 dark:bg-gray-950/50 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-gray-200/50 dark:border-gray-800/50 p-6 flex flex-col"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Platform</p><div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap md:flex-col gap-2 pb-2 md:pb-0"><button class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start w-[calc(50%-0.25rem)] sm:w-auto md:w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50 